# twin: render_one
# vulkan/negotiate_v1 with a core that draws only when its create_device
# was given a surface its queue can present to, as a core that shows its
# picture through a swap chain of its own does: the harness gives each
# console a headless surface.
console 0 core=test render=vulkan
option 0 link_test_render vulkan
option 0 link_test_vk_negotiate v1
option 0 link_test_vk_surface needed
30 checkpoint early
60 save mid
60 checkpoint mid
120 end
